KEY TESLA-T4 CUSTOMIZATION TAKEAWAYS:
1. Small Batch Inference (BS 1-8) is 100% MEMORY BANDWIDTH BOUND (~320 GB/s limit).
   -> Vectorized 128-bit loads (float4/uint4) & 4-bit quantization (W4A16) yield up to 4x latency reduction!
2. Large Batch / Training is COMPUTE & POWER BOUND (70W limit).
   -> Double-buffered register prefetching & tuning grid occupancy (avoiding 100% SM over-subscription)
      prevents GPU boost clock thermal throttling from 1590MHz down to 1000MHz.
